UID:state-corp-oregon-2025-05-15@ustaxcalendar.com
DTSTAMP:20260924T115707Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250515
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250516
SUMMARY:Oregon: State corporate income/franchise tax return due
DESCRIPTION:Oregon corporation returns due the 15th day of the month follow
 ing the federal due date (May 15 for calendar year)\; no separate state ext
 ension form - the extended due date is the 15th day of the month following 
 the federal extended due date\, computed here as November 16\, 2026 because
  November 15 falls on a Sunday. | Oregon corporation returns due the 15th d
 ay of the month following the federal due date (May 15 for calendar year)\;
  no separate state extension form - the extended due date is the 15th day o
 f the month following the federal extended due date\, computed here as Nove
 mber 16\, 2026 because November 15 falls on a Sunday. | Authority: Direct f
 etch of Oregon's own tax agency site/publication this session | Source: htt
 ps://www.oregon.gov/dor/programs/businesses/pages/corp-requirements.aspx | 
 This date is computed from a recurrence rule and may not reflect a later-an
 nounced change\; confirm against the cited source before relying on it.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
